  · exact graph288_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph289_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph290_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph291_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph292_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph293_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph294_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph295_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph296_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
  · exact graph297_impossible V hGP hSP hSQ hR
